Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.62,0:01:34.90,Main,Yuzu,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.75,0:01:39.81,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Every time I pass by here, \NI smell such lovely flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.81,0:01:41.28,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I've been so curious!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.66,0:01:42.56,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,As have I.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.98,0:01:45.84,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san, please pick \Na flower you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.84,0:01:48.62,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,What? I'm allowed to pick?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.62,0:01:50.35,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.03,0:01:51.88,Main,Yuzu,0,0,0,,What will it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.69,0:01:55.94,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,H-How about... roses?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.94,0:01:58.32,Main,Yuzu,0,0,0,,We happen to have wonderful roses today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.70,0:02:00.04,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.04,0:02:04.23,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Well, then... we'll take three.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.50,0:02:05.28,Main,Yuzu,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.04,0:02:09.10,Main,Yuzu,0,0,0,,Darling, wrap these up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.47,0:02:11.56,Main,Kemauchi,0,0,0,,Sure thing, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.32,0:02:13.52,Main - Top,Yuzu,0,0,0,,They'll be taking these.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.79,0:02:14.36,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}He's a big guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.52,0:02:14.38,Main - Top,Kemauchi,0,0,0,,Sure.{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.36,0:02:16.12,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}He sounds like he's high up...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.48,0:02:18.03,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Are you married?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.03,0:02:21.58,Main,Yuzu,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm human, \Nand my husband is an oni.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.58,0:02:23.12,Main,Yuzu,0,0,0,,We have an interspecies marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.12,0:02:28.31,Italics,Yuko,0,0,0,,{M}An interspecies marriage... \Nand we're an interspecies couple...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.58,0:02:30.08,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,YAKO - TONOME
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.34,0:02:34.39,Main,Yuzu,0,0,0,,That's right. You're the one who always \Nstops in front of our shop, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.77,0:02:37.78,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry I never come in...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.78,0:02:41.88,Main,Yuzu,0,0,0,,Hey, it's fine. We're \Nhappy you stopped by today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.06,0:02:43.50,Main,Kemauchi,0,0,0,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.74,0:02:45.58,Main,Kemauchi,0,0,0,,The baby's breath is on the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.58,0:02:47.52,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Why, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.99,0:02:51.49,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}It's amazing that he can wrap \Nflowers with those huge hands...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.22,0:02:55.69,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Where in the office shall I place them?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.69,0:02:56.75,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.87,0:02:59.45,Main,Yuzu,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.44,0:03:05.54,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Maybe on the table?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.70,0:03:07.92,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Yes, because it's the center of the room!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.19,0:03:14.16,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,The office is instantly transformed \Ninto a healing space!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.16,0:03:17.92,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,That reminds me. \NHave you always liked roses?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.92,0:03:19.88,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Oh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.26,0:03:25.50,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I've taken a liking to them \Nsince you gave me one, Akira-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.15,0:03:31.44,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You can say the most incredible \Nthings off the cuff, Shizuka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.61,0:03:34.88,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Well, let's put them on the table, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.88,0:03:36.59,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Yes, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.71,0:03:50.71,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Wh-What just happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.71,0:03:52.11,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.78,0:03:54.93,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,It's because I kicked the tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.67,0:03:58.08,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sure it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.08,0:04:01.08,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You can't make a sound like \Nthat just by kicking a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.08,0:04:02.84,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.84,0:04:04.55,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,Can't you tell from the horn?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.04,0:04:07.31,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You're from a species with horns?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.86,0:04:11.25,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I actually can't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.97,0:04:14.50,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,Oh, that explains that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.74,0:04:17.68,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,Hold out your hand. I'll help you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.42,0:04:19.32,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.13,0:04:25.44,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You're very strong, aren't you? \NThank you for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.67,0:04:28.16,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,I'm an oni-human mix.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.16,0:04:33.05,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,Oni are strong, but I'm still pretty bad \Nat controlling my strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.61,0:04:37.04,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,May I ask why it is \Nthat you kicked a tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.19,0:04:39.28,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,I was feeling frustrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.54,0:04:41.71,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,I was playing with friends, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.23,0:04:58.84,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,I only meant to tap her, \Nbut I still go too hard sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.16,0:05:02.80,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,I don't wanna play if I'm just gonna \Nmake people cry, so I slipped away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.96,0:05:07.38,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,How cool! Like a lone wolf!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.38,0:05:09.29,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,I'm really not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.77,0:05:16.53,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,But I don't think isolating yourself \Nis really a good solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.12,0:05:20.01,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,But... what should I do, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.01,0:05:22.15,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.10,0:05:26.57,Main,Wolfboy,0,0,0,,Yu! Where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.57,0:05:27.68,Main,Wolfboy,0,0,0,,We looked everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.68,0:05:31.39,Main,Wolfboy,0,0,0,,It's her fault for crying and say \Nshe didn't wanna play with you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.39,0:05:33.16,Main,Girl,0,0,0,,It's Yu's fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.16,0:05:35.44,Main,Lizard Boy,0,0,0,,Yeah, he made you skin your knee...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.69,0:05:37.42,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,L-Listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.42,0:05:39.50,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,How about we use this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.50,0:05:40.89,Main,Lizard Boy,0,0,0,,A cattail?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.00,0:05:43.91,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,I can tag you with it and not hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.38,0:05:47.31,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,L-Like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.05,0:05:49.69,Main,Wolf Boy,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.90,0:05:51.82,Main,Girl,0,0,0,,Well, I guess that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.04,0:05:53.48,Main,Wolf Boy,0,0,0,,That'd help with my claws, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.48,0:05:56.41,Main,Lizard Boy,0,0,0,,Let's all use them for the game!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.72,0:06:01.26,Main,Wolf Boy,0,0,0,,But it'll be hard to notice \Nwe've been tagged with those.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.26,0:06:02.52,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.52,0:06:03.94,Main,Girl,0,0,0,,How about making bundles?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.94,0:06:05.78,Main,Lizard Boy,0,0,0,,Yeah, I've got rubber bands!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.58,0:06:09.77,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.77,0:06:11.13,Main,Yuzu,0,0,0,,Welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.16,0:06:16.43,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I just can't get a handle on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.60,0:06:18.50,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,What's up, Tonome-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.89,0:06:21.14,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Hey, it's that guy again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.14,0:06:23.72,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes, my client believes \Nsomeone's smuggling
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.72,0:06:26.36,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,their product to sell \Non the black market.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.71,0:06:29.13,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,He's one of the suspects.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.83,0:06:33.16,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Hey, hey! Did my curse come in handy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.16,0:06:36.29,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Well, he didn't do anything \Nsuspicious that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.29,0:06:37.76,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,So it didn't matter at all?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.02,0:06:41.50,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.35,0:06:44.52,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Welcome. Is that you, Yu-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.52,0:06:46.80,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,Yeah! Hi, Yako-oneechan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.80,0:06:48.00,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.23,0:06:50.04,Main - Top,Yu,0,0,0,,Thanks for having me today!{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.24,0:06:49.33,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,What's all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.33,0:06:52.68,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,He's interviewing us about our jobs. \NFor school, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.04,0:06:51.08,Main - Top,Yako,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.08,0:06:56.60,Main - Top,Yako,0,0,0,,We run an agency, \Nso let me introduce you to the staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.68,0:06:54.14,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,He's someone you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.32,0:06:56.83,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,He's the son of a florist \Ncouple we've gotten to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.14,0:06:57.52,Main,Kid,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.28,0:07:03.05,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Tonome-san, this is Yu Kemauchi. \NHe'll be learning about our office today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.05,0:07:04.56,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.56,0:07:06.16,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.16,0:07:09.12,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm Tonome, the head detective here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.38,0:07:11.59,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.59,0:07:12.78,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.78,0:07:15.28,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,I was thinking I've seen this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.72,0:07:16.57,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You have?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.57,0:07:17.35,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.35,0:07:18.83,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,I was playing with my friends
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.83,0:07:21.33,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,and he yelled at me like, \N"You can't be here!"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.34,0:07:25.40,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Was it a dangerous area?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.40,0:07:27.56,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Do you remember where you were?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.24,0:07:28.80,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.99,0:07:31.90,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,I see. This area, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.99,0:07:32.38,Main - Top,Yu,0,0,0,,So what kind of job do \Nyou do, Yako-oneechan?{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.90,0:07:33.26,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes, most likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.38,0:07:38.55,Main - Top,Yako,0,0,0,,I handle the office finances \Nand manage everyone's schedules.{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.26,0:07:34.43,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'll scope it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.43,0:07:36.93,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,If we catch him \Nin the act, we've got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.93,0:07:38.18,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Won't it be dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.18,0:07:39.94,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,I'll arrange an escort.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.50,0:07:41.32,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yako-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.21,0:07:43.31,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm heading out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.06,0:07:45.50,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.38,0:07:50.20,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,Hey, are they going to the place I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.20,0:07:52.40,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I couldn't say!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.95,0:07:59.26,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,Yako-oneechan, thanks for the interview.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.26,0:08:01.25,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Is that all you needed?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.25,0:08:03.79,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'm sure Jarashi-san will be \Nback any minute now...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.79,0:08:05.11,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,Nah, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.11,0:08:05.96,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,I'm heading home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.42,0:08:07.16,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.03,0:08:22.65,Italics,Yu,0,0,0,,{M}I'm gonna tail this detective!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.87,0:08:25.64,Italics,Yu,0,0,0,,{M}It's my chance to see what \Nthe job's really about!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.80,0:08:27.82,Italics,Yu,0,0,0,,{M}I'll get a great report out of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.18,0:08:30.23,Italics,Yu,0,0,0,,{M}I know. I'll get pics too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.42,0:08:33.68,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,Huh? He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.35,0:08:36.41,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,I just lost sight of him for a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.71,0:08:38.17,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.61,0:08:43.80,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}Was that Yu-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.80,0:08:46.10,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}I sensed someone following me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.10,0:08:48.04,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}I didn't think he'd come after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.32,0:08:51.47,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}That's not safe. I'll get some \Ndistance and change my route there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.19,0:08:57.37,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}Now, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.95,0:08:59.29,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}So it's somewhere around there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.18,0:09:05.81,Main - Top,Human Man,0,0,0,,How much are we shipping?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.81,0:09:07.80,Main - Top,Bird Man,0,0,0,,Too much at once'll be suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.80,0:09:08.94,Main - Top,Bird Man,0,0,0,,We'll have to break it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.18,0:09:09.80,Main - Top,Bird Man,0,0,0,,When's payment?{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.56,0:09:10.77,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.80,0:09:12.32,Main - Top,Human Man,0,0,0,,After receipt. I'll hand it \Nover after it checks out.{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.36,0:09:13.99,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}That must be the group he's selling to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.32,0:09:15.18,Main - Top,Bird Man,0,0,0,,I want one lump sum at the end.{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.24,0:09:16.94,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}This is my chance \Nto catch him in the act.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.18,0:09:16.20,Main - Top,Human Man,0,0,0,,Got it.{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.20,0:09:19.27,Main - Top,Bird Man,0,0,0,,The shift changes today \Nare evening and late night.{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.28,0:09:19.26,Main,Hyena Man,0,0,0,,Hey! What the hell are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.16,0:09:23.02,Main,Hyena Man,0,0,0,,Slippery little brat...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.02,0:09:23.93,Main,Hyena Man,0,0,0,,C'mere!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.93,0:09:27.52,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,I-I wasn't doing anything! \NI was just looking for something!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.52,0:09:28.84,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.84,0:09:32.46,Main,Hyena,0,0,0,,This little brat \Nwas taking pictures of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.66,0:09:31.62,Main - Top - Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}Y-Yu-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.46,0:09:34.38,Main,Hyena,0,0,0,,Sneaking around the area, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.38,0:09:36.00,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,I wasn't doing anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.00,0:09:37.80,Main,Human Man,0,0,0,,Hey, we can't let those pics get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.62,0:09:39.86,Main,Bird Man,0,0,0,,I just remembered!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.86,0:09:43.05,Main,Bird Man,0,0,0,,He was hanging around here\Nyesterday as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.05,0:09:46.44,Main,Hyena Man,0,0,0,,Hey, someone send you to spy on us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.44,0:09:48.54,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.16,0:09:52.04,Main,Hyena Man,0,0,0,,This little brat's pretty strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.04,0:09:54.27,Main,Bird Man,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's an oni. Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.64,0:09:58.21,Italics,Yu,0,0,0,,{M}That's right. If I struggle \Ntoo much, I could hurt them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.25,0:10:03.07,Main,Hyena,0,0,0,,Hey, he settled down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.07,0:10:06.08,Main,Bird Man,0,0,0,,Take his phone and lock \Nhim in the back room.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.08,0:10:07.44,Main,Hyena Man,0,0,0,,C'mon, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.09,0:10:13.83,Main,Hyena Man,0,0,0,,I deleted the pics \Non his phone. What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.83,0:10:15.93,Main,Bird Man,0,0,0,,Let's contact the execs for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.93,0:10:16.89,Main - Top,Hyena Man,0,0,0,,What about the boss?{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.89,0:10:18.28,Main - Top,Bird Man,0,0,0,,He'll be here soon.{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.56,0:10:20.43,Main - Top,Hyena Man,0,0,0,,This is getting out of control.{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.84,0:10:22.46,Italics,Yu,0,0,0,,{M}What do I do? What's \Ngoing to happen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.40,0:10:22.85,Main - Top,Bird Man,0,0,0,,Well, what can you do?{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.52,0:10:26.60,Main,Bad Guy 1,0,0,0,,We can sell this kid for good money!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.86,0:10:29.67,Main,Bad Guy 2,0,0,0,,No, let's throw him \Nin the ocean so he can't tell no one!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.08,0:10:34.52,Main,Bird Man,0,0,0,,Shut up! Quit crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.52,0:10:36.08,Main,Hyena Man,0,0,0,,Pipe down already!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.39,0:10:40.41,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.04,0:10:47.01,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,No need to worry. I've called for backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.75,0:10:49.65,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'll show you a little bit of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.13,0:10:55.72,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.72,0:11:06.70,Italics,Yu,0,0,0,,{M}S-So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.70,0:11:08.16,Italics,Yu,0,0,0,,{M}I can't see him, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.16,0:11:10.83,Italics,Yu,0,0,0,,{M}Maybe I'll be a detective when I grow up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.62,0:11:13.48,Main,Goblin,0,0,0,,Yeah, this ain't great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.48,0:11:16.05,Main,Bird Man,0,0,0,,Right? We should probably \Npass on the word...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.05,0:11:17.16,Main,Goblin,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.98,0:11:21.36,Main,Goblin,0,0,0,,Hello? Well, we've got \Na little situation here...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.48,0:11:27.53,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'll untie you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.53,0:11:28.12,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.90,0:11:30.58,Main,Hyena Man,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.58,0:11:32.71,Main,Goblin,0,0,0,,They say leave the kid and move shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.22,0:11:34.37,Main,Human Man,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.37,0:11:35.91,Main,Bird Man,0,0,0,,Hey, hurry it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.91,0:11:36.86,Main,Orc,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.86,0:11:39.21,Main,Hyena Man,0,0,0,,Darn it. What a pain in my neck...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.00,0:11:41.97,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,It's dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.72,0:11:50.28,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,What do we do? I can't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.69,0:11:52.10,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,W-Wait just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.94,0:11:54.88,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.32,0:11:57.94,Italics,Yu,0,0,0,,{M}I'm glad the detective is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.94,0:11:59.41,Italics,Yu,0,0,0,,{M}He's like a superhero!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.20,0:12:04.44,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,Hey, what made you want to \Nbecome a detective?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.20,0:12:07.68,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Oh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.12,0:12:11.97,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,A long time ago, something happened. \NI wanted someone to find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.28,0:12:16.89,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,But nobody was able to, \Nand it made me very sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.08,0:12:24.10,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,So I became a detective to find \Nother people who want to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.10,0:12:28.16,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,Got it! And that's why you found me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.47,0:12:31.11,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm getting a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.11,0:12:31.97,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.05,0:12:34.19,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,Akira-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.19,0:12:36.30,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.47,0:12:39.12,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,I've made it in, and I'm with Yu-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.12,0:12:40.06,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Yu-kun?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.06,0:12:41.07,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Is he all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.07,0:12:43.16,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes. He wasn't harmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.77,0:12:45.40,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.53,0:12:47.67,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Say...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.67,0:12:48.45,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.96,0:12:52.80,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,Could you keep talking to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.80,0:12:54.43,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,Just to... distract me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.53,0:12:56.84,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Well, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.12,0:13:00.12,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Long, long ago, in a land far away...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.12,0:13:01.33,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Why a fairy tale?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.33,0:13:05.21,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Well, it's not easy to just keep talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.21,0:13:08.07,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry. A fairy tale is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.07,0:13:10.79,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'll start over, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.28,0:13:14.19,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Long, long ago, in a land far away,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.19,0:13:16.92,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,there lived an old woman and an old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.92,0:13:19.28,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,The old man went to punch the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.05,0:13:20.40,Main - Top,Man,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.40,0:13:25.28,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,The old woman went \Nto the river to race a peach.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.74,0:13:27.00,Main - Top,Woman,0,0,0,,You can't keep up with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.72,0:13:30.16,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Those two sound like they're \Nin rather good health.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.33,0:13:32.80,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,The peach was their victory prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.80,0:13:33.71,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,For what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.29,0:13:35.25,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Hey, Yako.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.25,0:13:36.92,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.08,0:13:42.32,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,I forgot to mention it, but Jarashi-san \Nand Karma-san just arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.00,0:13:46.19,Main,Goblin,0,0,0,,Should we check on the kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.19,0:13:47.00,Main,Bird Man,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.00,0:13:48.60,Main,Orc,0,0,0,,And the stuff on the second floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.60,0:13:49.99,Main,Human Man,0,0,0,,We're getting it down now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.99,0:13:50.64,Main,Orc,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.04,0:14:01.24,Main,Human Man,0,0,0,,Hey! What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.24,0:14:03.19,Main,Orc,0,0,0,,I just feel so weak...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.22,0:14:05.47,Main,Bird Man,0,0,0,,What's with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.47,0:14:07.44,Main,Orc,0,0,0,,I dunno! It just hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.44,0:14:08.94,Main,Human Man,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.10,0:14:10.01,Main,Cyclops,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.01,0:14:12.27,Main,Cyclops,0,0,0,,Should I head out ahead \Nonce we've got a full load?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.27,0:14:13.46,Main,Bird Man,0,0,0,,Yes, please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.46,0:14:14.13,Main,Cyclops,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.06,0:14:20.34,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Kikira, is the tracker working?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.34,0:14:21.11,Italics,Kikira,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.32,0:14:22.21,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.60,0:14:27.72,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,I can hunt down these \Nchild kidnappers myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.91,0:14:30.60,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Yeah, just keep it under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.25,0:14:34.03,Main,Bird Man,0,0,0,,Let's just get it finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.03,0:14:36.38,Main,Human Man,0,0,0,,Yeah, before the truck comes back—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.56,0:14:46.25,Main,Goblin,0,0,0,,Who're you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.14,0:14:50.52,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,If you give yourselves up quietly...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.82,0:14:52.92,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,I'm willing to show mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.16,0:14:55.22,Main,Human Man,0,0,0,,Crap. The jig's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.12,0:15:02.75,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Oh, is that how we're doing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.92,0:15:04.58,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,No mercy needed, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.57,0:15:10.19,Main,Bird Man,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.19,0:15:11.01,Main,Goblin,0,0,0,,You okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.01,0:15:12.97,Main,Bird Man,0,0,0,,Why, you...!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.64,0:15:32.21,Main,Goblin,0,0,0,,S-S-Sorry! Forgive me! Mercy, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.21,0:15:34.23,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.23,0:15:36.94,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,If you wanted to apologize, \Nyou shouldn't have started with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.94,0:15:39.95,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,I said you could give \Nyourselves up quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.87,0:15:45.38,Main,Goblin,0,0,0,,You really thought I'd \Napologize, you brute?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.16,0:15:49.16,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Why the hell do embezzlers have guns?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.51,0:15:51.51,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Watch it! Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.92,0:15:54.93,Main,Goblin,0,0,0,,Take that and that and that and that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.93,0:15:56.86,Main,Goblin,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.59,0:16:10.02,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Wasting my damn time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.50,0:16:12.91,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.45,0:16:17.16,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,You wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.36,0:16:19.33,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Just sit still!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.39,0:16:24.29,Main,Bird Man,0,0,0,,Catch me if you can! So long!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.29,0:16:25.25,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,You're not going anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.24,0:16:33.50,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Takes some guts to try to escape me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.50,0:16:34.17,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.88,0:16:35.90,Italics,Bird Man,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.97,0:16:42.68,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,I told her to keep it under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.55,0:16:45.56,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,The light's on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.36,0:16:47.85,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.15,0:16:50.36,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,You hurt, kiddo? You cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.36,0:16:51.88,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,I'm fine! And I didn't cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.88,0:16:52.96,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,For reals?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.96,0:16:53.68,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Where's Jarashi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.68,0:16:56.44,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,She beat the crap outta the bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.99,0:17:08.24,Main,Karma/Yu,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.24,0:17:10.81,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'll tie him up. Go get Jarashi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.81,0:17:11.59,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Yessir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.93,0:17:16.80,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,I just heard quite a sound! \NAre you all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.80,0:17:17.79,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.79,0:17:21.05,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Your distraction let me relax \Nuntil I had to spring into action.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.34,0:17:23.34,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,Your fairy tale was a big help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.44,0:17:26.15,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You're welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.63,0:17:29.10,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,Are Yu-kun and everyone else okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.10,0:17:31.62,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes. We'll all be heading back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.62,0:17:39.29,Flashback,Young Tonome,0,0,0,,Roll, acorn, roll. Roll, acorn, roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.82,0:17:44.16,Flashback,Young Tonome,0,0,0,,Oh, there it goes, right into the lake...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.56,0:17:45.41,Flashback,Young Tonome,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.79,0:17:47.06,Flashback,Young Tonome,0,0,0,,Which way was it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.14,0:18:07.49,Flashback,Young Tonome,0,0,0,,That's... the moon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.56,0:18:13.23,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Did you just say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.99,0:18:18.57,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Ah... Why am I lying on your lap?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.64,0:18:24.41,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I suggested it, since you seemed tired \Nfrom everything today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.95,0:18:29.00,Flashback,Yako,0,0,0,,Come along! Everyone's \Ngone home, so let's indulge!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.00,0:18:31.54,Flashback,Yako,0,0,0,,I've always wanted to \Nbe someone's pillow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.21,0:18:34.84,Flashback,Tonome,0,0,0,,Well, just for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.10,0:18:38.39,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,How long was I asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.39,0:18:40.67,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,About fifteen minutes, I think?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.00,0:18:54.60,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Did you just... kiss me? \NThat was very sudden...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.34,0:19:12.33,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Was that... what I've only read \Nabout in romance novels...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.33,0:19:15.10,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}A real grown-up kiss?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.07,0:19:19.24,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,A-Akira-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.14,0:19:23.51,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I want you by my side forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.71,0:19:25.53,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Aki...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.44,0:19:31.96,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I-I feel the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.54,0:19:36.20,Main,Yu/Kemauchi,0,0,0,,Good evening!\NTonome-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.67,0:19:37.78,Main,Yuzu,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.75,0:19:40.14,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Wh-What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.11,0:19:46.11,Main,Yuzu,0,0,0,,Thank you so much \Nfor helping my son today!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.56,0:19:44.60,Main,Kid,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.11,0:19:47.29,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Oh, not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.29,0:19:49.58,Main,Yuzu,0,0,0,,Hey, Yu! You have \Nsomething to say, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.58,0:19:50.05,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.05,0:19:54.59,Main,Yu,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry for causing \Nyou trouble today!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.59,0:19:56.04,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Not at all. I appreciate your help...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.04,0:19:58.16,Main,Yuzu,0,0,0,,We're very sorry to intrude.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.16,0:19:59.83,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Oh, you didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.83,0:20:02.00,Main,Kemauchi,0,0,0,,I'll leave our gift to you outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.00,0:20:02.64,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.63,0:20:09.57,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,L-Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.57,0:20:10.04,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.76,0:20:28.00,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,We've become like regulars at this bar!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.00,0:20:29.96,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,We have been here quite a few times.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.96,0:20:36.00,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,The first time we came, \NI imploded on alcohol a little, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.14,0:20:38.50,Flashback,Yako,0,0,0,,I have no romantic experience!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.38,0:20:41.12,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I thought that was charming, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.12,0:20:42.60,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Wipe it from your memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.07,0:20:47.56,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Actually, when I first \Ninvited you on a date,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.78,0:20:49.44,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,there was something \Nthat worried me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.32,0:20:54.23,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Because I'm older, and I'm your boss...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.41,0:20:58.36,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I thought you might feel like you \Ncouldn't say no. That I coerced you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.36,0:21:00.28,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I absolutely didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.28,0:21:03.28,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Well, I realize now that \Nit was an unfounded fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.28,0:21:05.61,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,It certainly was!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.79,0:21:09.08,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Actually, I've felt like \Nthe childish one around you lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.71,0:21:13.75,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You aren't! You've \Nhelped me out a lot, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.08,0:21:20.69,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I mean... I want us to be \Nable to rely on each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.69,0:21:22.40,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes. So...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.32,0:21:25.55,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I want to make it official.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.55,0:21:26.67,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Official?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.89,0:21:29.80,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's not that I haven't thought \Nabout it before, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.57,0:21:31.32,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.48,0:21:36.66,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'd like us to date with \Nthe goal of marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.30,0:21:38.57,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Marriage?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.57,0:21:39.46,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Is that a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.01,0:21:42.57,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,No, not a problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.57,0:21:44.90,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I want us to get married! We {\i1}will{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.90,0:21:45.89,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Well, not just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.89,0:21:47.20,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,We {\i1}won't{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.79,0:21:51.07,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You answered so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.07,0:21:52.91,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm not nervous anymore, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.33,0:21:59.96,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,After all, I want it to always \Nbe your hand that's guiding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.12,0:22:03.17,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,For now, shall we make plans to cohabit?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.17,0:22:04.96,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,We're cohabiting?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.96,0:22:05.90,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Not just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.97,0:22:09.97,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,EPISODE 7: I WANT YOU BY MY SIDE
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.19,0:22:08.76,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,But let's start planning for it.
